(90245,'','','','Hydra\'s Calling','','','','','','','','I saw people came and pass by. Most people do no know what do they need. People who is liberal with money but not happy, who has beautiful wife but drink to excess, who is learned but grudges his neighbor\'s wealth. But you are different, you know exactly what you need, I saw it. $B$BHydra is calling you, adventures are waiting for you, Lady Mornstar will provide you all you need.$BThe ship to Rookfeather will depart from the quay in half an hour. $B$BHydraroost will be the most beautiful ship in Rookfeather\'s port.$BTalk to Iverllios, Lady Mornstar\'s assistant, mention old Frank\'s name then you will be accept.','','','','','','','','Talk to Iverllios','','','','','','','','As a elf, I haven\'t saw fresh faces for long time, I mean, the human, they look similar with each others. It\'s so cool here, both the weather and life. Welcome to Hydraroost, the elf traveler\'s home. ','','','','','','','','The ship to Rookfeather will depart from the quay in half an hour. ','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Talk to Iverllios','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
