(90247,'','','','Jerome\'s Wine supply ','','','','','','','','To tell you the truth, Well, it\'s hard to open mouth, everything is fine except our stock of wine. We usually import wine from Town Shore. But the trade line has been cut off by a group of buccaneers. Town Shore may solve the problem now, but the lack of wine will not be solved in short time.$B$BFor this situation, I have a dangerous idea. Dangerous but effective. The Orcs have several wine factories, the nearest one, Chuk\'Nok, is located beside Giant\'s bone. If you can handle the fierce Workers, it\'s not so hard to get some productions form there.$B$BI don\'t want to lost credit to Lady Mornstar. If you can take back 10 boxes of Chuk\'Nok wine, I have good things for you.','','','','','','','','Take back 10 boxes of Chuk\'Nok wine','','','','','','','','Put aside the packaging, the Orc\'s wine is acceptable.','','','','','','','','I don\'t want to lost credit to Lady Mornstar, you know that.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Take back 10 boxes of Chuk\'Nok wine','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
