(90257,'','','','Eyes And Hands','','','','','','','','The Overlord is planing another murder. Emik is just an unlucky puppet. $BI just don\'t understand, why couldn\'t the Overlord ask us do to these things. You know, we are more professional when someone need something dead. Then we can save the trouble of the detecting job and report the result directly to our Miss Catty.$BYou have to know, we are not just eyes, we are also the hands. Since she send you here, she must want you to fix the problem.$BIverllios takes charge of these things, if you take back Emik\'s head, he and his hostness must be happy.','','','','','','','','Emik\'s Head','','','','','','','','Oh, a bleed head. This must be Chocker\'s sick joke again. He know that I hate dirty things like this.$BTake it away....wait, I have an idea.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Emik\'s Head','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
