(90260,'','','','Immigrant\'s Crisis','','','','','','','','The Gnoll, is the most dangerous menace to our life. My people keep on fighting against the Omu-Omi, the biggest Gnoll clan. We are fighting for our right to exist. $BBut recently a new king appeared. This young gnoll is not only strong but also thoughtful. Under his charge, Omu-Omi swallowed up several small gnoll clan and ruled half the iceland.$BWithout the civil war among the gnoll clans, my clan will become first aim soon.$BOur village is a bit far from Rookfeather, if you get there, our leader Kakya is waiting for you.$BMy friend, give me a hand, my people need you. ','','','','','','','','Go to Ice Heart and Talk to Kakya','','','','','','','','Welcome, my friend.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Go to Ice Heart and Talk to Kakya','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
