(90261,'','','','Inspection Staff','','','','','','','','We hired a geologist to inspect the Volcano, because we have to know everything well including the nature. $BThere\'s no report from him for a long time, I want you to go and urge him. $BHis name is Mudark Stoneslice, and, wow, he\'s an orc. $BI hate orc personally, but Lady Mornstar says that science has no boundary.$BWhatever, just go there and see what\'s wrong.','','','','','','','','Go to Post Zero and talk to Mudark Stoneslice ','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Go to Post Zero and talk to Mudark Stoneslice ','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
