(90287,'','','','Riot of Leopard','','','','','','','','I spend more than 40 years in the iceland, but I have never seen so many Long Tooth Snow Leopard together.$BIf I was young, I will rush into them and defeat them all. But I\'m too old and my sword is dull now. $BThe Overlord need 4 piece of unbroken skin of Snow Leopard, but his old guard cannot kill the beasts anymore. Kind-hearted traveler, would you help me? ','','','','','','','','Get 4 piece of Unbroken Snow Leopard Skin','','','','','','','','Look at the perfect figure, amazing nature. ','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Get 4 piece of Unbroken Snow Leopard Skin','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
