(90288,'','','','Riot of Wolf','','','','','','','','Dame, I\'m not purposely to make difficulties for you. $BBut I new notice of the task, the ice hair wolf king. We have to handle it too. $BThey even give it a name, they call the wolf king Lugas. $BThat\'s not funny, I mean they don\'t have to kill the huge beast.$BWell, you, my friend, I know you will take back Lugas\'s clwa for me.$BYou know, we are friend, I will get you something good.','','','','','','','','Get Lugas\'s Claw','','','','','','','','Look at the buster, it\'s even bigger than my hand.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Lugas\'s Claw','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
