(90289,'','','','Riot of Boar','','','','','','','','The bbbig boar, I ssaw it. I ffflowed you when you go out to kill the boars, you are soooo great. But I still wworried about big boar. I know it, it used to appear near the city, but it do not hurt people. Weeee give it a name, Boary, what a nname for a boar!$BBbbut I saw Boary became mad, it attttacked everything around it. Boary is dangerous now, please kill it, and it\'s bucktooth may be good ornaments. $B','','','','','','','','Get Boary\'s Buthtooth','','','','','','','','It\'s ssso heaaavy. I think I cccan hang it in my living room, tttthank you!','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Boary\'s Buthtooth','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
