(90290,'','','','Riot of Leopard','','','','','','','','I know Ryd，the king of snow leopard, once she was my friend. Now, she\'s just an enemy who attack my citizens. $BI miss the time I spent with she, but now I have responsibility for the city. I cannot, and don\'t want to do this with my own hands.$BIf you end her life, please take back her head. ','','','','','','','','Ryd\'s head','','','','','','','','She\'s eyes are so beautiful, but now there\'s nothing inside.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Ryd\'s head','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
