(90291,'','','','Ghost Gold Mine','','','','','','','','There are ghosts who eat soul in the mine, I said it. They just don\'t believe and laugh at me. They said they were looking for an real adventure. Now they should know. The ghost is not joke.$BThey, they do not come back, Van Vernon, Terence and Randall. I\'m worried about them, really. $BPlease, please go to the Sawa Mine and find my friend, it\'s a goaf not far from Roostfeather. ','','','','','','','','Find Casper\'s missing friend','','','','','','','','Help! Help me! They, they turn to zombie!','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Find Casper\'s missing friend','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','');
